= April 15, 1985 — Transition Headquarters

The morning after the victory, Alan García calls an emergency meeting with you and his inner cabinet.

"The country expects immediate results when we assume office in July," García says. "Where do we focus our transition team's efforts over the next three months?"

- @prep_economy: Draft emergency economic legislation (Plan Inti and price freezes).
- @prep_debt: Prepare foreign debt declaration (10% ceiling policy).
- @prep_security: Structure new intelligence and counter-insurgency oversight.
